[ELECROBO SENSOR]
Document: HC-SR04 Ultrasonic Distance Sensor Pinout & Specifications
Operating Voltage: DC 5V
Operating Current: 15mA
Operating Frequency: 40kHz
Range: 2cm - 400cm (Resolution: 0.3cm)
Trigger Input Signal: 10uS TTL pulse
Echo Output Signal: Output TTL level signal, proportional with distance range
Pinout: 
  Pin 1: VCC (5V)
  Pin 2: Trig (Trigger)
  Pin 3: Echo (Receive)
  Pin 4: GND (Ground)
Status: Public Technical Documentation
